# ---------------------------------------------------------------- scratch files
# Written by tooling in this repo, never part of the source. _msg.txt holds the text of a
# commit message while it is being composed, chk.txt holds command output.
_msg.txt
chk.txt
probe.txt
rel.txt
rel.json

# Captured command output. Twelve of these were tracked - build.log, capture.log, debug.log,
# build1..4.log and so on - which is history nobody wants and nobody reads: they are the console
# output of a build or a screenshot run at one moment in time. Every one of them is reproducible
# by re-running the thing that produced it.
*.log

# Marker files written by the capture and elevated-build harnesses to signal that a step
# finished. Their presence means nothing once the run is over.
elev_done.txt
test-report.txt
selftest.txt
selftest-hold.txt
langcheck.txt
/st-*.png

# Captured logs from a logger test, and the --healthtest result file.
NetPilot/healthcheck.txt
/logcheck/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- .NET build output
# The rule is anchored with a leading slash so it matches at the repository root and in each
# project directory, but not inside a path like src/obj-builder/ - which would be a real
# directory that happened to start with the same three letters.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- publish / release output
# Built artifacts and the store-upload staging directory. Everything here is reproducible from
# a clean checkout by Tools\Package-Rid.ps1, and none of it belongs in history: a 40 MB tarball
# in git is a permanent, uncompressible cost on every clone.
/release/
/NetPilot/dist/
*.apk
*.aab
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.sha256
TestResults/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Android / Gradle
NetPilotMobile/.gradle/
NetPilotMobile/build/
NetPilotMobile/local.properties
NetPilotMobile/app/build/
*.iml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- screenshots and captures
# Regenerated by the capture harness; the ones that belong in the repo are under
# NetPilot/Tools/assets and are added deliberately rather than ignored.
*.png
!NetPilot/Tools/assets/*.png
!NetPilotMobile/app/src/main/res/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.png
p7-diagnostics.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- signing credentials
# The release keystore, and the file holding its passwords.
#
# Anyone holding this keystore can ship an APK that Android installs as though it came from
# us, with our package name and our signature, and it cannot be withdrawn by publishing a new
# version. Both files were committed once in a public repository; they are untracked now and
# the commit was rewritten, but a published blob cannot be recalled.
#
# See docs\KEYSTORE-ROTATION.md. The existing key has to be replaced.
NetPilotMobile/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx


# ---------------------------------------------------------------- IDE
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store